{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Apple 發佈 macOS Golden Gate 27.2.1，為 macOS Golden Gate 作業系統帶來小型更新。Apple 的發佈說明指出，此版本包含錯誤修正與安全更新。</p>\n<h2>安全更新與下載途徑</h2>\n<p>更新亦可能包括一項修正，避免命令列工具接受 eMudhra 已遭入侵的網站憑證。Apple 已於 10 月 19 日封鎖該批憑證，因此大多數用戶已受保護。用戶可透過「系統設定」應用程式的「軟件更新」部分，以無線方式下載此更新。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"與 macOS Golden Gate 相關的圖片\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/macos-golden-gate-02.webp\" width=\"1280\"/></figure>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.353655+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":218,"images":1,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T18:36:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T13:55:17.954832+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:14:05.838872+00:00","content_hash":"0e26b4daba970b00005770d0888fcb7ab96411a5f66ca7af323670098325c5cd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}